          "formattedCitation": "<div class=\"csl-entry\">Dassi\u00e9, Jacques. \u201cLa grande lieue gauloise: Approche M\u00e9thodologique de la M\u00e9trique des voies.\u201d <i>Gallia</i> 56, no. 1 (1999): 285\u2013311. https://doi.org/10.3406/galia.1999.3011.</div>",
